Third-party work
----------------
* Provider parsing for WeebCentral, MangaPill, MangaKatana, MangaRead (Madara multisrc) and
  mgeko (MangaRawClub), and the Atsumaru API usage
  (CSS selectors, request logic, request pacing), and the
  extension JAR packaging/signing approach in buildSrc/, are adapted from
  keiyoushi/extensions-source (https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source),
  Copyright the Keiyoushi contributors, Apache License 2.0.
* The repository index schema follows mihonapp/tachiyomix index/index.proto
  (https://github.com/mihonapp/tachiyomix), Apache License 2.0, including the keiyoushi
  `Resources.jarUrl` (field 501) extension.
* The extension compiles against keiyoushi/extensions-lib (Apache License 2.0); it is a
  compile-only dependency and is not redistributed.

Data and services
-----------------
* MangaBaka (https://mangabaka.org). MangaBaka-original data is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0;
  third-party data belongs to its respective providers. Attribution is shown in each series
  description. The API is used unauthenticated within its documented rate limits.
* AniList (https://anilist.co) GraphQL API, used read-only and unauthenticated.
* MangaDex (https://mangadex.org) public API.
Library of Alexandria hosts no content and runs no server; all requests are made from the
user's device.
